      "source": [
        "**Reasoning**:\n",
        "Now that the required libraries are imported, I will initialize DBSCAN, apply it to the scaled DataFrame to identify anomalies, and then use PCA to reduce dimensionality for visualization. Finally, I will plot the results to show the detected anomalies.\n",
