        "**Reasoning**:\n",
        "First, I will separate the features (X) from the target variable (y) in `df_scaled`. Then, I will encode the categorical 'pollution_category' into numerical labels using `LabelEncoder`. Finally, I will split the data into training and testing sets using `train_test_split` to prepare for model training.\n",
        "\n"
